  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the newest update 3.11.22 it's not possible to actually select any locomotion options other than the narrow comfort tunnel if you're using Vive Wands.\nTo recreate: Log into VRChat with Vive Wands, then try to change locomotion in Accessibility options.\nResult: Locomotion type does not actually change, while UI indicates a change. UI tooltips also throws a message regarding finger tracking being enabled/disabled if Holoport is selected.\nPerhaps the game thinks we're using finger tracking, which was introduced with this update?",
